 "own_rule_reading": [
  "bars: NOADJ_NQ_5m_RTH.csv registry row, window 2010-06-07..2016-06-30 (ET dates); session = the master's day_id (ET day).",
  "in-session bar index = the prereg's convention (TTM #145): clock of the bar's OPEN, (minutes since 09:30)/5; bar 0 = 09:30.",
  "morning range = max(high) - min(low) over the session's bars 0..11 (opens 09:30..10:25, complete at 10:30 = 'high[0:12]'); a session with no bar in that clock span has no morning range (cannot qualify, not counted in later medians).",
  "trailing median = median of the morning ranges of the 20 PREVIOUS sessions (today excluded: 'trailing'); all 20 required, so the first 20 sessions of the window cannot qualify. Qualify iff morning range >= wide_k x trailing median (>=).",
  "ATR(14) 'computed on 5m closes': per-bar input = |close[i] - close[i-1]| (closes only, no high/low true range); Wilder smoothing ATR_i = (13 ATR_{i-1} + |dC_i|)/14; RESET each session (the text's k >= 14 is an in-session index, i.e. the ATR warm-up); seed = the mean |dC| over the session's first 14 closes (bars 0..13, 13 differences), value at bar 13; atr_k at bar k >= 14 includes bar k's own |dC_k| (the value 'at' bar k, known at its close).",
  "signal on a qualifying session: the first bar k with in-session index >= 14 and close[k] > close[k-1] + atr_k (long) or close[k] < close[k-1] - atr_k (short), strict; k+1 must exist inside the same session (a last-bar signal is dropped).",
  "entry = open of bar k+1 (the next bar in the session).",
  "stop: initial = entry - side x trail_k x atr_k (atr_k = the SIGNAL bar's ATR, as written, fixed for the trade); checked intrabar from the entry bar on (long: low <= stop, short: high >= stop) and fills at the stop; a bar after the entry bar that OPENS at/through the stop fills at its open; after the check, at each bar's close the stop trails: long stop = max(stop, close - trail_k x atr_k), short stop = min(stop, close + trail_k x atr_k) (ratchet only, never loosens).",
  "no target; flat at the session's last bar CLOSE if not stopped (the stop is checked on the last bar first).",
  "one trade per session: the first qualifying signal only; no re-entry that session.",
  "pts gross = side x (exit - entry); cost subtracted per trade afterwards; $ booked on the exit bar's ET date.",
  "knob values: the prereg's Data section says 'params = the file's DEFAULT_PARAMS defaults'; the Mechanism gives no wide_k / trail_k values, so B was frozen with blind picks wide_k 1.5, trail_k 2.0 (+ a grid), then, AFTER freezing and BEFORE reading the plugin's logic, only the plugin's DEFAULT_PARAMS literal was read and B re-run at those values (the B row diffed vs A)."
 ],
